      "text": "#HYDTPinfo\n🚦 TRAFFIC ADVISORY 🚦\nIn view of the Hon’ble President of India’s visit to Hyderabad from 17-12-2025 to 22-12-2025, traffic may be temporarily stopped or diverted at various junctions across the city during specified times due to VVIP/VIP movements.\nCommuters are requested to take note of the advisory, plan their travel in advance, and cooperate with traffic personnel on duty.\n#TrafficAdvisory #HyderabadTraffic #VVIPMovement #TrafficAlert #PlanYourTravel #TrafficUpdate  #PublicAdvisory",
